WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:23.730
Bird and Kip were out on the ocean.

2
00:00:23.731 --> 00:00:32.709
The box floated on the waves.

3
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:36.906
It bobbed up and down.

4
00:00:36.907 --> 00:00:40.561
"We're sailing, Kip!" said Bird.

5
00:00:40.562 --> 00:00:45.796
"And I'm having a lot of fun!"

6
00:00:45.797 --> 00:00:52.762
But Kip wasn't having fun at all.

7
00:00:52.763 --> 00:00:57.347
"We're lost!" he cried.

8
00:00:57.348 --> 00:01:01.241
"We'll be lost at sea forever!"

9
00:01:01.242 --> 00:01:04.547
"Oh, don't be silly, Kip," said Bird.

10
00:01:04.548 --> 00:01:08.064
"We won't be lost at sea forever.

11
00:01:08.065 --> 00:01:12.860
We're not even lost."

12
00:01:12.861 --> 00:01:18.491
"I miss my hole!" cried Kip.

13
00:01:18.492 --> 00:01:22.138
"And I miss our tree!

14
00:01:22.139 --> 00:01:31.043
I don't like sailing anymore!"

15
00:01:31.044 --> 00:01:38.885
Soon the box landed on some rocks.

16
00:01:38.886 --> 00:01:48.872
"Oh no!" said Kip.

17
00:01:48.873 --> 00:01:54.463
"Now we're stuck in a faraway land!"

18
00:01:54.464 --> 00:01:57.529
"No, we aren't," said Bird.

19
00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.400
"We're still home.

20
00:01:59.401 --> 00:02:09.410
See? There's the roller coaster."

21
00:02:09.411 --> 00:02:14.185
"Hmm," said Kip. "You're right."

22
00:02:14.186 --> 00:02:17.751
"Do you know what this means?" asked Kip.

23
00:02:17.752 --> 00:02:30.781
"We sailed all the way around the world!"
